/span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.620" end="00:35.430"><span begin="00:31.620" end="00:31.860">But </span><span begin="00:31.860" end="00:32.310">she </span><span begin="00:32.310" end="00:32.820">tied </span><span begin="00:32.820" end="00:33.180">one </span><span begin="00:33.180" end="00:33.510">on </span><span begin="00:33.510" end="00:34.050">big </span><span begin="00:34.050" end="00:35.430">time</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.490" end="00:39.000"><span begin="00:35.490" end="00:35.820">And </span><span begin="00:35.820" end="00:36.120">it </span><span begin="00:36.120" end="00:36.660">makes </span><span begin="00:36.660" end="00:36.900">me </span><span begin="00:36.900" end="00:37.380">wanna </span><span begin="00:37.380" end="00:39.000">rewind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.030" end="00:43.050"><span begin="00:39.030" end="00:39.240">To </span><span begin="00:39.240" end="00:39.870">back </span><span begin="00:39.870" end="00:40.050">in </span><span begin="00:40.050" end="00:40.200">the </span><span begin="00:40.200" end="00:40.980">days </span><span begin="00:40.980" end="00:41.220">when </span><span begin="00:41.220" end="00:41.520">we </span><span begin="00:41.520" end="00:42.060">were </span><span begin="00:42.060" end="00:43.050">young</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.080" end="00:46.800"><span begin="00:43.080" end="00:43.410">When </span><span begin="00:43.410" end="00:44.250">everything </span><span begin="00:44.250" end="00:44.460">was </span><span begin="00:44.460" end="00:44.850">like </span><span begin="00:44.850" end="00:44.910">a </span><span begin="00:44.910" end="00:45.900">loaded </span><span begin="00:45.900" end="00:46.800">gun</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.830" end="00:50.640"><span begin="00:46.830" end="00:47.430">Ready </span><span begin="00:47.430" end="00:47.550">to </span><span begin="00:47.550" end="00:47.940">go </span><span begin="00:47.940" end="00:48.180">off </span><span begin="00: